WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.034 --> 00:00:09.863
<b>The Glass Bottle Part 1</b>

2
00:00:18.728 --> 00:00:21.847
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Hassan and Walid are brothers.

3
00:00:22.409 --> 00:00:26.542
They live in a small house in the desert, near the mountains,

4
00:00:26.633 --> 00:00:31.546
a long way from a town or village. They’re very poor.

5
00:00:31.691 --> 00:00:35.408
They have no money and they have no animals.

6
00:00:36.043 --> 00:00:38.726
Their house only has two rooms.

7
00:00:39.252 --> 00:00:41.590
Every day is the same.

8
00:00:41.989 --> 00:00:46.123
They get up, and they have sweet black coffee for breakfast.

9
00:00:46.612 --> 00:00:52.251
Then Hassan works in the fields – but Walid just sits

10
00:00:52.269 --> 00:00:56.992
and looks at the hot, empty desert and the hot, empty sky.

11
00:00:57.944 --> 00:00:59.276
They live with their mother.

12
00:00:59.965 --> 00:01:03.845
She looks after them, but she’s old and tired.

13
00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:09.492
One day she says, ‘We’re poor and hungry.

14
00:01:09.928 --> 00:01:13.300
Why don’t you leave here and find work?

15
00:01:13.735 --> 00:01:17.053
We need money for food and clothes.’

16
00:01:17.850 --> 00:01:21.875
‘If you want some money, you have your silver ring –

17
00:01:21.966 --> 00:01:24.994
you can sell that,’ answers Walid.

18
00:01:25.501 --> 00:01:28.366
‘I can’t sell it,’ she says.

19
00:01:28.620 --> 00:01:30.415
‘It’s your father’s.

20
00:01:30.940 --> 00:01:34.748
Every night I look at it and remember him.’

21
00:01:35.618 --> 00:01:40.585
Hassan wants to help his mother, and he decides to leave home.

22
00:01:41.111 --> 00:01:45.444
His mother gives him bread, and water in a glass bottle.

23
00:01:45.970 --> 00:01:49.959
He kisses her and he walks towards the mountains.